{
  "Mode": "Paranoid",
  "Description": "Hardcore privacy profile - exact policy state is applied, while effective support remains edition/build dependent (NOT recommended for production)",
  "BestFor": "Air-gapped, kiosk systems, extreme privacy requirements only",
  "Warnings": [
    "AllowTelemetry=0: Enterprise/Education only (Pro falls back to Required=1)",
    "Broad Force Deny set: Mic, Camera, Location, Contacts, Calendar, etc.",
    "Denied microphone/camera capabilities are unavailable to affected conferencing apps",
    "WerSvc disabled: Windows Error Reporting service is unavailable while this state is applied",
    "Scheduled tasks disabled: CEIP, AppExperience, DiskDiagnostic",
    "Online font providers are disabled; only locally installed fonts remain available to Windows components",
    "Automatic device-metadata companion-app downloads are disabled",
    "Not recommended for general workstations; validate in a controlled environment"
